  "sn17.32:1.1": "sāvatthiyaṃ viharati … tatra kho bhagavā … ",
  "sn17.32:1.2": "dāruṇo bhikkhave lābhasakkārasiloko …pe… ",
  "sn17.32:1.3": "lābhasakkārasilokena abhibhūtassa pariyādinnacittassa bhikkhave devadattassa kusalamūlaṃ samucchedamagamā. ",
  "sn17.32:1.4": "evaṃ dāruṇo kho bhikkhave lābhasakkārasiloko …pe… ",
  "sn17.32:1.5": "sik khitabbanti. ",
  "sn17.32:1.6": "dutiyaṃ. "
}
